      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.09 (vs ₹0.98 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.09 (up from ₹0.98 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹491.9m (down 19% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹260.0k (up ₹3.22m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.1% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 66 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
